      "value": "Thanks for your report. Please provide the ID of the avatar that demonstrates this issue to help with investigation. There's no need for the avatar to be public, we can work with private avatars.\n\nAdditionally, please confirm which version of the SDK you're using. The Disable On Miss property was removed in the 3.10.3 SDK release where VRCRaycast was introduced, so you may still be using a beta SDK package.",
