      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name}\n\nYou got it boss! You're right about it being the beta, but I will say the problems persisted outside of it, when the prefab was imported to a project running 3.10.3 \n\nFor the sake of making your lives easier I've updated to the live release and remade the raycasts (included a picture of the current settings). I've included an ID to the test avatar I was using below, lmk if you need anything else\n\navtr_b7e48e8d-8b48-4067-8bef-398b6860f322",
