      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name}\n\nI just realized I linked the wrong avatar, or rather that I uploaded the test avi to a different ID than I gave you, which explains why it wasn't working despite the update\n\nNo need to worry about the \"disable on miss\" since that was just something I enabled for convenience's sake, it's not necessary for the prefab to function\n\nEverything seems to work on the updated avi, my bad for not noticing the ID issue",
